#: ../../source/production/gateway.rst:63
msgid ""
"Kubernetes discovery requires ``--installation-namespace`` to name an "
"existing, accessible namespace. Packaged deployments use the gateway Pod "
"namespace by default. Pod, ModelAdapter, and ModelClaim discovery stays "
"within this namespace; there is no cluster-wide fallback. For Helm, set "
"``gatewayPlugin.installationNamespace`` to select another existing workload "
"namespace and grant the matching discovery permissions."
msgstr ""
"Kubernetes 发现功能要求通过 ``--installation-namespace`` 指定一个已存在且可访问的命名空间。打包部署默认使用网关"
" Pod 所在的命名空间。Pod、ModelAdapter 和 ModelClaim 的发现均限制在此命名空间内，不会回退到集群范围。对于 "
"Helm，可通过设置 ``gatewayPlugin.installationNamespace`` "
"选择另一个已存在的工作负载命名空间，并授予相应的发现权限。"

#: ../../source/production/gateway.rst:108
msgid ""
"The duration is the maximum age of a successful verification, not a polling "
"interval; zero (the default) preserves the existing behavior. The first list"
" request, and the first request after that age expires, obtains a current, "
"paginated Kubernetes LIST of Pods and enabled ModelAdapters in the "
"installation namespace and compares it with events already applied to the "
"gateway cache. Only one verification runs at a time. A failed or mismatched "
"LIST, a request timeout, or a reported watch error invalidates the previous "
"proof. The endpoint returns HTTP 503 with a ``service_unavailable`` error "
"until a later verification succeeds; retries after failure are limited to "
"once every five seconds. A healthy installation with no models still returns"
" HTTP 200 with an empty list. Each gateway replica performs its own "
"verification, so choose the duration with API-server load in mind. The "
"verification request has a ten-second timeout."
msgstr ""
"此时长表示成功验证结果的最长有效时间，而非轮询间隔；零值（默认值）保留现有行为。首次列表请求以及有效期到期后的首次请求，会对安装命名空间内的 Pod "
"和已启用的 ModelAdapter 执行当前状态的分页 Kubernetes "
"LIST，并与已经应用到网关缓存的事件进行比较。同一时间只执行一次验证。LIST 失败或不匹配、请求超时或收到 watch "
"错误都会使之前的验证结果失效。端点将返回 HTTP 503 和 ``service_unavailable`` "
"错误，直到后续验证成功；失败后的重试最多每五秒一次。没有模型的健康安装仍返回 HTTP 200 和空列表。每个网关副本独立执行验证，因此选择时长时应考虑"
" API 服务器负载。验证请求的超时时间为十秒。"

#: ../../source/production/gateway.rst:126
msgid ""
"The gateway plugin serves both ``GET /v1/models`` and ``GET /v1/models/`` on"
" its HTTP port. The packaged Kustomize and Helm routes send these requests "
"to the plugin Service on port 8080; the Helm Envoy sidecar uses the local "
"plugin HTTP port. ``/v1/files`` and ``/v1/batches`` keep their existing "
"metadata destination in Envoy Gateway mode. Confirm the HTTPRoute's "
"``Accepted`` and ``ResolvedRefs`` conditions before relying on it. The list "
"mode comes from ``--model-list-mode``."
msgstr ""
"网关插件在其 HTTP 端口上同时提供 ``GET /v1/models`` 和 ``GET /v1/models/``。打包的 Kustomize 和"
" Helm 路由将这些请求发送到插件 Service 的 8080 端口；Helm Envoy sidecar 则使用本地插件 HTTP 端口。在 "
"Envoy Gateway 模式下，``/v1/files`` 和 ``/v1/batches`` 仍发送到原有的元数据服务。使用该路由前，请确认 "
"HTTPRoute 的 ``Accepted`` 和 ``ResolvedRefs`` 条件。列表模式由 ``--model-list-mode`` "
"决定。"
